e.'","The tombstone-prune work is in THIS leaf (epic child cb2b / S2b); sibling 25a4 (alias scaffolding) states 'No tombstone is needed' and does not touch mechanism delta, so no sibling covers this obligation.","tests/unit/test_mechanism_delta.py:379-386 test_the_committed_baseline_matches_the_live_tree asserts set(baseline)|admitted == live; make verify runs it, so removing censused env_var tombstone names without --update-stale makes the leaf's own AC5 (make verify) fail.","The leaf's Testing section lists only the three generator --checks, ruff C901, and make verify; it never names check_mechanism_delta.py, the mechanism baseline, or the required commit-message line."],"finding":"The leaf omits the mechanism-delta maintenance step the parent epic explicitly mandates for the tombstone-prune story: running scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --update-stale in the same change and recording it in the commit message.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2c1db6439e2ca368","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan 'Testing' / 'Acceptance Criteria' (AC5); vs parent epic e12f operator-sanction clause","norm_id":"naca125e2f2da6e83","priority":0.7778,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Leaf removes the 7 warn env tombstones (TICKETS_TRACKER_DIR, REBAR_PUSH, ...); the committed mechanism baseline goes stale and make verify / test_the_committed_baseline_matches_the_live_tree fails, so AC5 cannot pass as written."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In the Testing/AC sections, add the mechanism-delta update (and commit-message note) as an explicit step and AC, mirroring precedent commit 81da792 which drained env_var::REBAR_HLC.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_fol